-- erwartet: D020
-- **A field of a BOUND MAPPING that stands nowhere.**
--
-- The fourth question at a quantifier, and the first one about the VARIABLE instead of the
-- place. `D017` reads the base name, `D018` its kind, `D019` the field names of its suffix --
-- and all three stop at the place. **`mappings of` is the one domain that binds a record**
-- (`SPRACHE.md` §6: *"A domain binds the ADDRESS of an entry … `mappings of` is the one
-- exception"*), so it is the one domain where `m.field` means anything at all, and it was the
-- one nobody read.
--
-- MEASURED 2026-09-01 against the UNCHANGED checker: this very declaration, with
-- `!m.gibtsnicht` in an `invariant`, gave
--
--     …: 3 items, 0 errors, 0 hints
--
-- **`Pte` has no field of that name and no pass said so.** The control in the same run: the
-- same line with a falsified BASE name (`mappings of GibtsNicht`) does fall, at `D017`.
-- *The base is read and the variable's field is not.* Word for word the sentence `D019` says
-- one level down -- and the cause is the same and it is written in `domaene.rs`:
-- `ortsfelder_pruefen` **returns early on a bound name**, because a quantifier variable
-- carries no type in that pass. For `mappings of` the type is no guess: it stands in the
-- `walk` declaration, three lines above.
--
-- WHY THIS ONE IS NOT A TIDINESS RULE
-- ------------------------------------
-- A mapping carries TWO families of field, and the second one decides a cost question.
-- The node `format` gives the ENTRY's bits; `va`, `level` and `index` are SYNTHESISED from
-- the position (`SPRACHE.md`:930, *"including virtual address and level"*). An invariant that
-- reads only entry bits survives a subtree being grafted anywhere; one that reads `va` does
-- not, because a graft re-derives every `va` under it **without a single bit changing**.
-- `PLAN-HARDWARE.md` §5 Layer 2 turns on exactly that split, and until this rule nothing in
-- the tree could make it.
--
-- THE COUNTER-PROBE STANDS IN THE SAME FILE
-- ------------------------------------------
-- `wx_getrennt` reads `m.schreibbar` and `m.nx` -- fields of the node `format` -- and
-- `stellung_wird_gelesen` reads `m.va`, which is not in the `format` at all and is carried by
-- the domain. Neither falls. **Three invariants over one `walk`, and only the invented field
-- is refused.**

module gift {

format Pte endian little {
    praesent   : bool @0,
    schreibbar : bool @1,
    nutzer     : bool @2,
    pte_frei   : u64 @[11:3] reserved,
    rahmen     : u64 embeds [51:12] scale 4096,
    pte_hoch   : u64 @[62:52] reserved,
    nx         : bool @63,
}

walk Seitentabelle levels 4 {
    node : [Pte; 512],
    down : rahmen when it.praesent,
    leaf : !it.praesent,

    -- Counter-probe 1: fields of the node `format`. Does not fall.
    invariant wx_getrennt cost O(n) runs online :
        forall m in mappings of Self : !(m.schreibbar && !m.nx);

    -- Counter-probe 2: `va` stands in NO `format` and is carried by the domain.
    -- Does not fall either.
    invariant stellung_wird_gelesen cost O(n) runs offline :
        forall m in mappings of Self : m.va < 0xFFFF_8000_0000_0000 || !m.nutzer;

    -- THE POISON: `gibtsnicht` is neither in the `format` nor among the three position fields.
    invariant erfundenes_feld cost O(n) runs online :
        forall m in mappings of Self : !m.gibtsnicht;
}

}
